============
django-polls
============

django-polls is a Django app to conduct web-based polls.

Quick start
-----------

1. Add "django_polls" to INSTALLED_APPS.

2. Include URLconf:

    path("polls/", include("django_polls.urls"))

3. Run migrations.

4. Start server.
